  "intuition": "Construct all pairwise preferences by selecting pairs where the first objective is better than the second, weighting pairs linearly by the positive gap in objective values, ensuring all weights are nonnegative by clamping at zero.",
  "hyperparams": {
    "geometry_family": "dense_all_pairs",
